  "Out[215]//MatrixForm=",ExpressionUUID->"b66c111b-d94f-4b4f-b842-\
54c3bb1bd733"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The TN payoff is concrete: in block-sparse storage the off-diagonal terms \
are never computed. For two generic tensors the within-sector sums still \
total ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["256", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8098c256-5456-4ea0-ad97-21562b990f02"],
 " multiplications, so no savings. The win appears when a tensor is \
constrained to a single sector. A Riemann-like tensor lives only in the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "2", ",", "2", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"e0bcf950-f627-4083-8ffe-9620445311b1"],
 " block, so its contraction with any partner only sees the partner's ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "2", ",", "2", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3f584d8c-fc1d-4fbe-b918-6a5f4974f557"],
 " component: a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["40", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "99197fe3-7bad-4ac1-8f97-b5a88248c0be"],
 "-multiplication contraction instead of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["256", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c3a3a1e0-a248-446e-821a-f41c0d3bef5d"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5af63f37-2614-480e-a2f2-bd0efef3f199"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"T2riemann", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"T2blk", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
     RowBox[{"T1", " ", "*", " ", "T2riemann"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"T1blk", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "*", " ", 
      "T2riemann"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[216]:=",ExpressionUUID->"dc9c4572-bec3-41d8-8b5a-4d87b9adc5ef"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"1.3279028510554916`", ",", "1.327902851055491`"}], "}"}]], "Output",\

 CellChangeTimes->{3.98882041454732*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[217]=",ExpressionUUID->"9742fab2-eb79-47d6-865a-dc6376cb803c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Both contractions return the same scalar: only the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "2", ",", "2", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"b5a47e43-e34b-4b16-9ecc-e854a241551e"],
 " projection of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["T", "1"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8a367d96-c7dd-4f44-b12d-6820ca084717"],
 " contributes when its partner is Riemann-like. That is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"6.4", "\[Times]"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"5e7fc032-1632-4dc8-b043-dc62abe792d2"],
 " FLOP saving on this single bond contraction, with no approximation. In a \
many-tensor TN of symmetric or curvature-like tensors the per-bond savings \
compound multiplicatively, and the dimension table above tells the \
contraction-path optimiser which sector products to skip before any \
multiplication runs."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cd1e1541-21ad-4df9-837b-e258bd08d139"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["A class-function Hamiltonian and content sums", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fae39f57-ec72-4020-9a1b-bd8882bf8770"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A permutation-invariant Hamiltonian ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"H", "=", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{"i", "<", "j"}]], " ", 
    SubscriptBox["P", 
     RowBox[{"i", "\[NoBreak]", "j"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"fc4037bd-9523-451b-8e06-6594c1216214"],
 StyleBox[" on ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["n", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "978b3710-50f7-469f-869b-9738725e2e72"],
 StyleBox[" identical sites commutes with every isotypic projector, so its \
spectrum is the list of content sums ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"c", "(", "\[Lambda]", ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"1904c4e1-4cc0-4f6d-9292-5ebd0e7dafbe"],
 StyleBox[" over partitions of ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["n", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3274f850-444a-4583-9675-dba6d6e4e899"],
 StyleBox[" with multiplicities ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"dim", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["V", "\[Lambda]"], "\[CenterDot]", "dim", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["W", "\[Lambda]"], "(", "d", ")"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"29b17c2c-0a4a-4751-9b4c-3aa0a34b7cd7"],
 StyleBox[". ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "TableauDimension", "paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TableauDimension"},
   "RefLink"]], "Text",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "7b652bdc-1961-478b-800d-15787f148a31"],
 StyleBox[", ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{"HookLengths", "paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/HookLengths"},
   "RefLink"]], "Text",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "f37929c4-c519-4e2b-9682-765ca5ef951d"],
 StyleBox[", and ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "SchurDimension", "paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/SchurDimension"},
   "RefLink"]], "Text",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9168eec2-d94c-4e21-817b-916aab8ba4f0"],
 StyleBox[" deliver every spectral line and degeneracy in closed form, no \
eigenvalue routine needed.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2b08001a-5945-42d7-961e-512475ca42db"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The dimensions alone are useful, but the Symmetry functions also \
pre-compute eigenvalues of Hamiltonians that are ",
 StyleBox["class functions",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["S", "n"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "489bf28b-780e-4a16-88b2-e1f3dbccb1c5"],
 ": operators built from permutations whose value depends only on cycle \
structure. The classic example is the sum of all pair-swaps,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f0f45d7b-c7b5-4464-b4e6-2da000c421e1"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"H", " ", "\[MediumSpace]", "=", "\[MediumSpace]", " ", 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    RowBox[{"i", "<", "j"}]], " ", 
   SubscriptBox["P", 
    RowBox[{"i", "\[NoBreak]", "j"}]]}], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b11b20a2-27ce-4374-a632-898a750d7d52"]], \
"Text",ExpressionUUID->"3544ca45-ac49-4ebc-8d09-1a92ed61e781"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "acting on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["V", 
    RowBox[{"\[TensorProduct]", " ", "n"}]], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"d545c912-3306-4d24-92fd-6384d22676ca"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", 
    RowBox[{"i", "\[NoBreak]", "j"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"62781651-a5f4-4950-b00a-4b9fa88eadcc"],
 " is the swap of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["i", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cac528c8-2318-4386-bc51-411e7a8cb2c9"],
 "th and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["j", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5f57a6c7-b60a-42dd-b171-04dc6492f52f"],
 "th tensor factors. By Schur-Weyl, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["H", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "98295e97-41b7-4734-959e-e115e1fed3ae"],
 " commutes with every isotypic projector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["E", "\[Lambda]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"6b0204f9-5244-4815-ab0b-fe4ceefa2db5"],
 " and is therefore ",
 StyleBox["constant on each ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Lambda]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a110cd86-cb99-4699-8f99-0c991cfb2246"],
 StyleBox["-block",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". The constant is the ",
 StyleBox["content sum",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " of the partition,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1097b5d1-ace8-4148-a0e1-6703c200a0a7"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
  "c", "(", "\[Lambda]", ")", "\[MediumSpace]", "=", "\[MediumSpace]", " ", 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "i", ",", "j", ")", "\[Element]", "\[Lambda]"}]], "(", "j", "-",
    "i", ")", ","}], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"677b7a22-3d7e-4597-aa79-b49a584f8f90"]], \
"Text",ExpressionUUID->"b7397ca5-5305-4e33-8ea1-5d0d91fe7d63"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "a simple sum over diagram cells. For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"n", "=", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "700b510e-9416-4f7d-88a8-d7e791c8c472"],
 " the three partitions give ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
   "c", "(", "{", " ", "3", " ", "}", ")", "=", "0", "+", "1", "+", "2", "=", 
    "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fdde3bef-1053-4bd5-ad3c-8aa3ace83a87"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
   "c", "(", "{", " ", "2", ",", "1", " ", "}", ")", "=", "0", "+", "1", "-", 
    "1", "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "27e71bf9-fdce-4355-a452-933ebf535c40"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
   "c", "(", "{", " ", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", " ", "}", ")", "=", "0", "-", 
    "1", "-", "2", "=", "-", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"896b2bbd-cf8b-4cd2-9491-1c1715870e5c"],
 ". Together with the block multiplicities from the Schur-Weyl example \
earlier, ",
 StyleBox["this is the full spectrum of ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["H", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "49e81ce1-e645-48fd-85cc-33e695bf3ddb"],
 StyleBox[" with multiplicities",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bb87df18-9914-4cb8-a07e-8ff3e8bcf484"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The eigenvalue ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"c", "(", "\[Lambda]", ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"15d154ff-3f58-4f50-b773-c8ca253dbc48"],
 " depends only on the ",
 StyleBox["partition",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", not on any tensor data. Sanity-check that ",
 StyleBox["IntegerPartitions[3]", "Code"],
 " produces legal Young-diagram shapes before consuming them in the formula."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"81d0ad7b-5354-4d09-b6b9-53d79323806a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"IntegerPartitions", "[", "3", "]"}], ",", " ", "PartitionQ"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[218]:=",ExpressionUUID->"676e0906-6723-48eb-b2dc-39261c6489d0"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.98882041455558*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[218]=",ExpressionUUID->"595e68ae-a03c-416f-a255-aa7883f3bd6d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["Encode the content sum:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9be3a80b-f321-4a32-9004-e8d4921d68cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"contentSum", "[", "par_List", "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{"Total", " ", "@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Flatten", " ", "@", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"j", " ", "-", " ", "i"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "par", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"par", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[219]:=",ExpressionUUID->"58aadaca-1faa-4221-93e1-c91861a13a7e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "=", "2", ",", "n", "=", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"9bf80304-5b59-4641-a529-605039489d40"],
 " the predicted spectrum is"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6af051a1-a455-4557-8618-47d68ed21ab6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"predicted", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Sort", "[", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Flatten", " ", "@", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\n", "        ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"contentSum", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", "3", "}"}], "]"}], ",", "       ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"TableauDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", "3", "}"}], "]"}], "       ", "*", " ", 
          RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "3", "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       "\n", "        ", 
       RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"contentSum", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"TableauDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "    ", "*", " ", 
          RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
       RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"contentSum", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"TableauDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "*",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "\n", "    ", "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
    "    ", "Greater"}], "\n", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[220]:=",ExpressionUUID->"274d8d7f-1a2d-417c-8385-8fed29bebf56"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"3", " ", 
    TemplateBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "3", "}"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}, "ImplicitList"]},
     "SymbolicOnesArray"]}], ",", 
   TemplateBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}]}, 
      "ImplicitList"]},
    "SymbolicZerosArray"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", "3"}], " ", 
    TemplateBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "[", 
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}, 
       "ImplicitList"]},
     "SymbolicOnesArray"]}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.988820414570649*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[220]=",ExpressionUUID->"754d3a2a-046f-444a-b8a4-052f28404bd4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Four eigenvalues equal to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["3", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6ee1af2b-08e8-4d7e-86f9-028ed8c67ff8"],
 " in the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "3", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"38dbec8c-15db-410f-9189-dfb75c4afa02"],
 " block (four-dimensional), four equal to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "53994259-8dcb-4df6-8510-363675cd91fc"],
 " in the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "2", ",", "1", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"9d37efee-4762-4b89-8387-f447a1eb31e9"],
 " block (also four-dimensional), and zero copies of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ee2642fd-0aec-41d7-ac98-8108f580e1f2"],
 " because the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", " ", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", " ", "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"1a85060e-cd3b-4367-b606-7417247e157e"],
 " block is empty at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "=", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4fd30631-9c0f-42a6-9d10-be85f63fbc2f"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00a932a6-020e-4cf2-8bb1-90dd62499cfb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Cross-check against an explicit matrix diagonalisation. First, build a \
helper that realises one pair-swap ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", 
    RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"e92b27fd-8adf-4849-981b-16b5f42557a2"],
 " as a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["d", "3"], "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["d", "3"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"5d2a99e6-31d4-4fdc-bbfd-f73fcd7e0c7f"],
 " matrix at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "=", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "200b0a74-2923-411a-b80b-691dbbb02e22"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"15a776f4-ca08-4293-b3c2-5decbf7d74e3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"applySwap", "[", 
    RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"perm", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"perm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"perm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "a"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "    ", 
      RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", "\n", "        ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "\n", "            ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Normal", " ", "@", " ", 
           RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", "\n", "                ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                   "i", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "k", ",", " ", "i", ",", " ",
                     "j", ",", " ", "k"}], "}"}], " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", 
                 "\n", "                    ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
               "2"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "                ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
              "2", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2",
                ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "\n", "            ", "]"}]}], ",", 
          "\n", "            ", 
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{"perm", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", "6"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
         "\n", "        ", "]"}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"8", ",", " ", "8"}], "}"}]}], "\n", "    ", "]"}]}]}], "\n",
     "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[221]:=",ExpressionUUID->"079d9904-e4bf-4e11-8397-b3444227a3ea"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Assemble ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"H", "=", 
    SubscriptBox["P", "12"], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["P", "13"], "+", 
